[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3724465188","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100923#issuecomment-3724465188","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100923","id":3724465188,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7d_tQk","user":{"login":"j20001970","id":71766835,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNzY2ODM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71766835?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970","html_url":"https://github.com/j20001970","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-08T15:44:55Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T15:44:55Z","body":"The PR has been narrowed down to one smaller changes to make it more specific.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3724465188/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3739634856","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100923#issuecomment-3739634856","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100923","id":3739634856,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7e5kyo","user":{"login":"j20001970","id":71766835,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNzY2ODM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71766835?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970","html_url":"https://github.com/j20001970","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-12T17:20:02Z","updated_at":"2026-01-12T17:20:02Z","body":"> I don't really know the use case (some concrete examples would be helpful)\r\n\r\nWhen custom camera feeds added to `CameraServer` are accessed with `CameraServer.get_feed(index)` (or `CameraServer.feeds()` which returns `Array[CameraFeed]`), the returned type is `CameraFeed` if static typing is used: In that case custom feeds written in GDScript or GDExtension cannot provide or configure available formats, as `CameraFeed.get_formats` and `CameraFeed.set_format` are not override-able unless static typing is not used.\r\n\r\nFor a more specific example, custom camera feeds provided by GDExtension addons like [CameraServerExtension](https://github.com/j20001970/godot-cameraserver-extension) could not override `get_formats` and `set_format` if accessed like this (as stated in README in the project repository):\r\n```gdscript\r\nvar feed := CameraServer.get_feed(0)\r\nvar feed_formats := feed.get_formats()\r\n```\r\n\r\nWith this PR, custom feeds will be able to provide and configure formats by overriding `_get_formats` and `_set_format`, just like overriding `_activate_feed` and `_deactivate_feed` for feed activation/deactivation.\r\n\r\n> With this PR, all the `virtual` methods on this class have GDExtension bindings, except for `get_format()`. Should that virtual method be made available via GDExtension as well?\r\n\r\nAFAIK `CameraFeed::get_format` is currently used by [`BufferDecoder`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/788beb36dc54ee4307a32d52e4895017d3620375/modules/camera/buffer_decoder.cpp#L46) only for determining frame size and V4L2 pixel format. I don't think there are use case for `get_format` virtual bind via GDExtension when it seems to be only used by `BufferDecoder` internally.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3739634856/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3814574352","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100923#issuecomment-3814574352","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100923","id":3814574352,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jXckQ","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-29T00:04:02Z","updated_at":"2026-01-29T00:04:02Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3814574352/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]